| Cost Component            | Year 1 | Years 2–5       |
| ------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| Salesforce Licenses       | ✓      | ✓               |
| Experience Cloud Licenses | ✓      | ✓               |
| Implementation            | ✓      | —               |
| Data Migration            | ✓      | —               |
| Integrations              | ✓      | ✓ (maintenance) |
| Security & Compliance     | ✓      | ✓               |
