| Large enterprise application               | 9–15 months      |
| Multi-agency or highly integrated platform | 15–24+ months    |

For a typical government application (for example, replacing a case management or customer service system with Salesforce Service Cloud and Experience Cloud), **9–12 months** is a common delivery timeframe.

