For a **medium-to-large Salesforce implementation in a New Zealand government agency (9–12 months)**, the delivery team typically consists of **12–25 people**, although not everyone is full-time throughout the project.

Here's a representative team structure.

| Role                                                | Typical FTE* | Primary Responsibility                           |
| --------------------------------------------------- | :----------: | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Executive Sponsor                                   |      0.1     | Funding, strategic decisions                     |
| Programme/Project Manager                           |       1      | Delivery, budget, schedule                       |
| Solution Architect                                  |       1      | Overall solution design and technical governance |
| Business Architect / Business Analyst               |      2–3     | Requirements, process mapping, user stories      |
| Salesforce Technical Lead                           |       1      | Technical leadership, code quality               |
| Salesforce Developers                               |      2–5     | Apex, Lightning, integrations                    |
| Salesforce Administrator / Configuration Specialist |      1–2     | Configuration, Flows, security, reports          |
| Experience Cloud Developer                          |      1–2     | Portal development and branding                  |
| Integration Developer                               |      1–2     | APIs, middleware, external systems               |
| Data Migration Specialist                           |       1      | Data extraction, cleansing, migration            |
| Test Manager                                        |       1      | Test planning and coordination                   |
| Test Analysts                                       |      2–4     | SIT, UAT support, defect management              |
| Change Manager                                      |       1      | Organisational change, communications            |
| Training Lead                                       |       1      | User training and documentation                  |
| Security / Infrastructure Specialist                |     0.5–1    | Identity, SSO, security reviews                  |
| Release / DevOps Engineer                           |       1      | CI/CD, deployments, environment management       |

*FTE = Full-Time Equivalent. For example, 0.5 FTE means roughly half of a person's time.

