## Solution Architect's Role Throughout the Project

The Solution Architect is one of the key technical leaders.

### During Discovery

* Lead architecture workshops.
* Assess the current application landscape.
* Define the target-state architecture.
* Identify technical risks.
* Produce the solution blueprint.

### During Design

* Design the data model.
* Define security and sharing.
* Design integrations.
* Review the Experience Cloud architecture.
* Define non-functional requirements (performance, availability, scalability).

### During Build

* Conduct design and code reviews.
* Guide developers on best practices.
* Review integrations.
* Resolve technical issues.
* Govern architecture decisions.

### During Testing

* Validate the architecture against requirements.
* Review performance and security.
* Ensure integration quality.
* Approve production readiness.

### During Go-Live

* Oversee deployment and cutover.
* Review rollback plans.
* Resolve critical technical issues.
* Support hypercare.

